---
// "Sources" and the list, on every page that uses data. Links go to the reference list or the toolkit data page.
---
<p class="src t-caption"><strong>Sources</strong> <slot /></p>

<style>
  .src { color: var(--grey-dark); max-width: var(--measure); }
  strong { color: var(--ink); margin-right: 0.6em; }
  .src :global(a) { color: var(--ink); }
</style>
